{"id":2239,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2239"},"modified":"2025-10-02T09:52:00","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T09:52:00","slug":"decorative-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/decorative-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Decorative Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Fast Production and Free Nationwide Shipping<\/h2>\n<p>We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong><\/a> offer fully customizable <strong>decorative cardboard boxes<\/strong> designed to suit retail packaging, gift presentation, product storage, and more. Whether you&#8217;re preparing gifts, organizing merchandise, or packaging clothing, our decorative boxes serve as both a practical container and an attractive part of the product experience.<\/p>\n<p>Available in various styles, colors, and sizes, including <strong>decorative cardboard boxes with lids<\/strong>, these boxes add refinement without overcomplicating your packaging process. You can choose from different finishes, printing methods, and shapes. Plus, we provide <strong>free design support<\/strong>, quick production, and <strong>free shipping<\/strong> on every order.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Built to Store, Display, and Impress<\/h2>\n<h3>Ideal for Retail, Events, or Personal Use<\/h3>\n<p>Our boxes are used by gift shops, event planners, clothing brands, home storage product sellers, and subscription services. Each box is made with care to balance durability with a clean visual appeal.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Suitable for apparel, accessories, keepsakes, and gift items<\/li>\n<li>Includes options for two-piece lids, magnetic closures, or auto-lock bottoms<\/li>\n<li>Available in small, medium, <strong>large decorative cardboard boxes<\/strong>, and oversized formats<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Boxes arrive flat-packed and assemble easily. This makes them a convenient solution for both shipping and in-store display.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Decorative Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<table style=\"height: 415px;\" width=\"765\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature<\/th>\n<th>Description<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Sizes Available<\/td>\n<td>Fully Custom Sizes (Small to Extra Large)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Kraft, Corrugated E-flute, Paperboard<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Capabilities<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, One-color, Two-color, Inside and Outside<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Types<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Closure Styles<\/td>\n<td>Lid &amp; Base, Tuck End, Magnetic Closure, Gable<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Add-ons<\/td>\n<td>Ribbons, Inserts, Die-Cut Windows, Spot Foil<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Usage<\/td>\n<td>Retail, Gifts, Apparel, Keepsakes, Subscription Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Food Safe<\/td>\n<td>Available Upon Request with FDA-Compliant Coating<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Proof Options<\/td>\n<td>Flat View, 3D Mock-up, Physical Sample Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Order Quantity<\/td>\n<td>Starts at 100 Boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days Standard, Rush Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Delivery<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Free Services<\/td>\n<td>Layout Assistance and File Setup Included<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Decorative Paper Boxes for Elegant Presentation<\/h2>\n<h3>A Visual Packaging Solution That Feels Premium<\/h3>\n<p>The structure and print finish of <strong>decorative paper boxes<\/strong> help brands offer packaging that\u2019s more than just a container. These boxes are frequently used for:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Beauty and self-care kits<\/li>\n<li>Holiday and seasonal gift packaging<\/li>\n<li>Clothing presentation boxes<\/li>\n<li>High-end retail accessories<\/li>\n<li>Event giveaways and promotional items<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you need minimal branding or full-color printing, we can customize your box design to reflect your brand\u2019s identity.<\/p>\n<h3>Common Types We Manufacture<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Decorative cardboard boxes for clothes<\/strong> \u2013 flat and spacious for folded garments<\/li>\n<li><strong>Decorative gift boxes with lids<\/strong> \u2013 classic two-piece style for gift presentation<\/li>\n<li><strong>Extra large decorative cardboard storage boxes with lids<\/strong> \u2013 heavy-duty for home or retail storage use<\/li>\n<li><strong>Decorative cardboard storage boxes<\/strong> \u2013 reusable and practical for organizing personal or retail items<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>You can also request inserts or dividers for more organized packaging.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3000\">Common Configurations<\/h3>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3576\">\n<thead data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3103\">\n<tr data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3103\">\n<th data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3012\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3022\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Material Options<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3061\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Finishing Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3082\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Add-ons &amp; Features<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Usage\/Application<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3576\">\n<tr data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3325\">\n<td data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Apparel Boxes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3238\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flat, spacious<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">White Kraft, Coated Board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, Soft-touch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3304\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Divider inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3325\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fashion, Garments<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3448\">\n<td data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3339\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gift Boxes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3360\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Two-piece with lid<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3385\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Paperboard, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3428\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ribbons, Magnetic flaps<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3448\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seasonal gifting<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3576\">\n<td data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3465\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Storage Boxes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3488\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Heavy-duty, XL sizes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated E-flute<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3524\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anti-scratch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3552\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Handles, Reinforced edges<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3576\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail, Home storage<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Finish, Print, and Coating Options<\/h2>\n<h3>Add Lasting Appeal to Your Packaging<\/h3>\n<p>Finishing options can help protect the box surface and elevate its appearance. We offer:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gloss coating<\/strong> for a shiny, reflective surface<\/li>\n<li><strong>Matte coating<\/strong> for a softer, textured look<\/li>\n<li><strong>Spot UV<\/strong> to highlight logos, text, or custom patterns<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also add specialty options like:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Die-cut windows for product visibility<\/li>\n<li>Ribbons or magnetic flaps for gift-ready packaging<\/li>\n<li>Branded inserts to secure items in place<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>All coatings are applied precisely to maintain a professional finish across each unit.<\/p>\n<h3>Long-Term Storage and Gift Packaging Use<\/h3>\n<p>Many of our clients order <strong>decorative gift boxes wholesale<\/strong> for retail sales, events, or corporate gifting campaigns. Our sturdy boxes make it easier for customers to reuse them as keepsake containers or home organizers\u2014especially with stylish finishes and secure lids.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4183\">Finishing and Coating Options<\/h3>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4723\">\n<thead data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4286\">\n<tr data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4286\">\n<th data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4195\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4205\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4205\" data-end=\"4224\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Material Options<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Finishing Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4244\" data-end=\"4265\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Add-ons &amp; Features<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Usage\/Application<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4723\">\n<tr data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4504\">\n<td data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4398\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Coating<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Shiny or textured<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4418\" data-end=\"4442\" data-col-size=\"sm\">FDA-safe Paper, Kraft<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4461\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss, Matte, UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Food-safe lamination<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4484\" data-end=\"4504\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Food &amp; cosmetics<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4609\">\n<td data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4516\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Branding<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4516\" data-end=\"4538\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exterior &amp; Interior<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4538\" data-end=\"4550\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CMYK, PMS<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4572\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full panel printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo embossing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4723\">\n<td data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Durability<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4623\" data-end=\"4643\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Long-term storage<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4643\" data-end=\"4662\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4662\" data-end=\"4684\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lamination, Varnish<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reinforced corners<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Keepsake boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Buy Decorative Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3>Benefits of Ordering in Bulk<\/h3>\n<p>Purchasing decorative packaging in volume provides value in both cost and consistency. Whether you need boxes for retail shelves, promotional giveaways, or product packaging, <strong data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"339\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-functionality\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"337\">Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/a><\/strong> wholesale orders help streamline operations.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lower unit pricing across larger quantities<\/li>\n<li>Faster restocking with saved box templates<\/li>\n<li>Uniform packaging across product lines<\/li>\n<li>Reduced risk of shortages during busy seasons<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>To view more packaging built for specific uses, browse our Cardboard Boxes By Functionality collection. It includes categories designed around practical applications like storage, mailing, gifting, and more.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>How to Place Your Order<\/h2>\n<h3>Simple Steps to Start Your Project<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Select your box dimensions, quantity, and style<\/li>\n<li>Choose printing options, add-ons, and finish types<\/li>\n<li>Upload your artwork or request free design help<\/li>\n<li>Approve a digital proof or request a sample<\/li>\n<li>Receive your boxes with free shipping, ready to pack and present<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Each order is reviewed and supported by our in-house packaging experts to ensure quality from design to delivery.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Additional Packaging Options Available<\/h2>\n<p>If you&#8217;re also managing storage, mailing, or seasonal packaging projects that require compact shipment solutions, we recommend checking our range of <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/foldable-cardboard-boxes\/\">Foldable Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong>. These are easy to store, ship flat, and assemble in seconds\u2014making them a smart addition alongside decorative packaging.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you need rigid containers for display or collapsible formats for storage efficiency, we offer a complete solution for all packaging demands.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes for Decorative Packaging<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom <strong>decorative paperboard boxes<\/strong> made to your size and style<\/li>\n<li>Multiple lid styles, coatings, and print finishes available<\/li>\n<li>Free design help and fast turnaround times<\/li>\n<li>Options for <strong>decorative cardboard boxes for clothes<\/strong>, gifts, and storage<\/li>\n<li>Durable materials and smart folding styles<\/li>\n<li>Competitive wholesale pricing and low minimums<\/li>\n<li>Free nationwide shipping on all orders<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Request a free quote today and customize your Decorative Cardboard Boxes with Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for decorative cardboard boxes that add a touch of elegance to your products. Available in custom sizes and styles, these boxes provide a durable solution with a range of coating options, including Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV. We provide free design and shipping, along with fast turnaround times to ensure your projects are completed efficiently. Quote Now!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2357,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[181],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2239","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-functionality","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Get Decorative Cardboard Boxes | Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Elevate your products with our customizable decorative cardboard boxes. Premium materials, fast turnaround, and free design services.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/decorative-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Get Decorative Cardboard Boxes | Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>